Usage: %s [NUMBER]...\n\
  or:  %s OPTION\n\
"),
              program_name, program_name);
      fputs (_("\
Print the prime factors of each specified integer NUMBER.  If none\n\
are specified on the command line, read them from standard input.\n\
\n\
"), stdout);
